		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Legendary Ladle</strong> &middot; <strong>Price:</strong> 1 g 9 s (Sold out)</p><p><em>Some heroes become legends because of their armaments. Others become legends in spite of it.</em></p><hr><p><strong>1d6+STR Bludgeoning.</strong></p><p><strong>Ladlor's Tenacity.</strong> (Req. a daring spirit) The first time each encounter you would gain Dying, set your HP to 1 and gain the following benefits for 2 turns:</p><ul><li>Add LVL to damage</li><li>Immunity to all damage</li><li>Ignore rushed attacks</li></ul><p><em>While you carry the ladle, the module intercepts the killing blow and applies Ladlor's Tenacity automatically (once per encounter).</em></p><p class=\"nim-plus-credit\"><em>&mdash; Santuric, Nim+ Volume IV</em></p>",
